    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Could Go Wrong?\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\uddea\ud83d\udca5 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A one-staff budget bio-lab sim where science is cheap, ethics are optional, and disaster is... inevitable.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;What Could Go Wrong?&quot;</strong>, the dangerously underfunded bio-lab management game where you're the only thing standing between scientific progress and global annihilation. No pressure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your lab on a shoestring budget, juggle moral dilemmas, and see how long you can keep the world from catching fire (literally).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Highly Questionable Job Includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udd2c <i>Splicing exotic pathogens\u00a0</i>\u2014 because the world definitely needs a chickenpox-zombie hybrid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udcb0 <i>Stretching your budget\u00a0</i>\u2014 top-tier containment tech or more duct tape? Decisions, decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\ude2c <i>Managing sudden outbreaks\u00a0</i>\u2014 who could've predicted this totally unforeseen incident?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i>Cutting shady deals\u00a0</i>\u2014 ethically gray governments, morally bankrupt megacorps... friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Dubious Science\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Theoretical, experimental, and occasionally catastrophic. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd14 <strong>Moral Mayhem\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Profit vs. public safety: pick one (or neither). \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Unintended Consequences\u00a0</strong>\u2014 A small lab accident may or may not trigger global panic. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Dark Humor\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Because if the world's ending, at least it should be funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ethical compromises \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mild to severe apocalypse \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dubious funding sources \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highly infectious fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc89 <strong>&quot;What Could Go Wrong?&quot;\u00a0</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only game where &quot;Oops&quot; is a project milestone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <i>Coming soon! (Pending incident reports... and legal review.)</i> </p>",
